---
// MarketingHeroNew.astro
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafc] pt-36 md:pt-44 pb-24 md:pb-32" id="marketing-hero">
  <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Text Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">
          Reexaminăm website-ul dumneavoastră fără a renunța inutil la ceea ce funcționează deja.
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Website-ul nu mai corespunde companiei, pare depășit tehnic sau vizual, sau nu mai susține obiectivele actuale? Analizăm ce există și stabilim ce poate fi păstrat, ce trebuie îmbunătățit și ce trebuie reconstruit.
        </p>
        
        <div class="pt-4 mt-4">
          <button class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg text-lg self-start">
            Evaluare gratuită
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Visual Column (Offset Graphics) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex justify-center items-center">
        <!-- Main Circular Graphic -->
        <div class="w-72 h-72 sm:w-80 sm:h-80 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative border-8 border-white bg-blue-50">
           <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Hero Person" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
        </div>
        
        <!-- Floating Elements -->
        <div class="absolute top-4 left-0 lg:-left-6 bg-white rounded-xl p-3 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-100 z-20">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">Q</div>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Search on platform</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-0 lg:-right-6 bg-white rounded-xl p-3 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-100 z-20">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">✓</div>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Swipe Check</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

